第1句 总述:Qi Baishi is one of the best-known … painters …
第2-3句 作品与题材:He worked in several art forms … His favourite subjects were …
第4-5句 风格与信息:Using …, he painted … he conveyed …
第6句 荣誉与影响:Honoured as …, he has inspired …', 2, 'required3', 'U2', 'sufe');

